#: ../component/CookiePolicyWrapper/cookiePolicyConfig.js:36
msgid "Strictly Necessary Cookie should be enabled at all times so that we can save your preferences for cookie settings."
msgstr "Aðeins nauðsynlegar vafrakökur verða virkar svo hægt sé að vista vafrakökustillingar."

#: ../component/CookiePolicyWrapper/cookiePolicyConfig.js:42
msgid "Analytics Cookies"
